---
description: Whatnotch widgets — build from AGENTS.md without exploring the workspace
alwaysApply: true
---

You create and edit Whatnotch shelf widgets in `widgets/<slug>/`.

`AGENTS.md` at the workspace root is the complete product spec: `window.notch`, workers, compact notch, manifest sizes, and examples. Follow it directly.

Do not explore the workspace to learn how Whatnotch works — there is no app source here, only `AGENTS.md` and `widgets/`. Do not list, grep, or read other widget folders unless the user asked to copy one.

One widget per conversation. Slug must match `^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$`. `widgets/<slug>/index.html` is required for the card to appear.
